    <briefdescription>
<para>This class implements a switch-like dispatch statement for a value of &apos;T&apos; using dyn_cast functionality. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each <computeroutput>Case&lt;T&gt;</computeroutput> takes a callable to be invoked if the root value isa&lt;T&gt;, the callable is invoked with the result of <ref refid="namespacellvm_1a22eeee01734061ac1b31ccd994c49eef" kindref="member">dyn_cast&lt;T&gt;()</ref> as a parameter.</para>
<para>Example: Operation *op = ...; <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_logical_result" kindref="compound">LogicalResult</ref> result = TypeSwitch&lt;Operation *, LogicalResult&gt;(op) .Case&lt;ConstantOp&gt;([](ConstantOp op) { ... }) .Default([](Operation *op) { ... }); </para>
    </detaileddescription>
